# L §6.4 Its items (round 11b): "A read is by name: a base item evaluated in the scenario reaches the scenario's things
# through its bindings over their kind (`x in places on d` holds a place the scenario's file declares, as it holds a
# thing a scenario version enters), which names none of them." total binds over accounts and n_gifts over gifts; sc
# declares the account lokata and the move bonus of kind gifts. Not LOAD-SCENARIO: in the base, total sees konto alone
# (its opening, 100.00) and no gift; in sc it sees lokata too, zero at its lifespan's start plus bonus (20.00 into
# lokata on 2027-03-10), by L §5.10's bal (the anchor plus the legs since): 120.00. (Writer 8, sixth pass: lokata had an
# opening of 50.00 at 2027-01-01 start, after K 2026-12-31, which "a reading applies only before the cut K", L §5.19,
# and E §4.2 step 0, round 18 C2-2, leave unapplied; the bonus now goes into lokata so total still shows it.)
=== base.tally
model base
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2028-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind gifts: event certain
  leg cash: PLN
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2019-05-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..

def total[d in days]: money PLN
  rule r = sum(bal(a, d) for a in accounts on d)

def n_gifts[m in months]: int
  rule r = count(g in gifts over m)

version v1
  cite s
  governs 2026..
  known 2025-12-01
  opening[konto] = 100 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "wyciąg"

ask qb: total[2027-06-01]
ask nb: n_gifts[2027-03]
=== sc.tally
scenario sc over base
  tally 2
  from 2027-01-01

place lokata: accounts PLN lives 2027-01-01..

input bonus_day: date
input bonus_amt: money PLN

move bonus: gifts
  on bonus_day
  leg cash from world to lokata amount bonus_amt

version bonus_plan
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-06-01
  bonus_day = 2027-03-10 "plan"
  bonus_amt = 20 PLN "plan"

ask qs: total[2027-06-01] in sc
ask ns: n_gifts[2027-03] in sc
=== expect
nb: 0
  cut 2026-12-31
ns: 1
  world: sc
  cut 2026-12-31
qb: 100.00 PLN
  cut 2026-12-31
qs: 120.00 PLN
  world: sc
  cut 2026-12-31
